WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.568
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:03.568 --> 00:00:07.680
KATIE RICHARDSON: We have many
people from diverse backgrounds

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.600
who are getting certified.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.450
But what we find is that,
especially for individuals

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.090
who are interested
in certifications,

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.710
it could be that
they are looking

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:21.960
to go into a new job role or
just upscale in a certain area.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:26.370
They want to demonstrate that
they are skilled in something

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.500
specific and not
only demonstrate

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.150
that to their peers, but also
to potential future employers.

00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:36.510
So really, I think it's
about career advancement.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:40.710
But also, it can be more,
I think, self-motivated,

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:43.230
where you just want to
prove to yourself that you

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.160
have these skills.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:47.130
Maybe you've been studying
something for a period of time.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:50.880
You've been completing trainings
or practicing something

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.960
on your own.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:56.160
And getting that certification
is kind of that milestone--

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:58.020
proof that you
have those skills.

00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:02.220
Certifications in particular
can be used by individuals

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:07.440
to learn new skills, motivate
themselves to learn new skills,

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.140
find a new job, move
into a new area that's

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.680
interesting to them.

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:15.060
And so our goal is to help
signal to the industry,

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.860
or maybe just to
their teams if they're

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:19.410
staying within
their same job role,

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:22.260
that they have specific
skills, that they

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:29.010
have met this standard for the
industry and for that job role.

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:33.420
So that recognition, the
career advancement, but also

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:37.290
the just intrinsic
validation for yourself

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:41.150
that you have the skills that
you need to do your job well.

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:44.200
[MUSIC PLAYING]

